    and the orphaned BBV slice-consume test test_plugin_phase_consume.sh, whose
    only surviving dependencies were the icount= fallback arg and the deleted
    fixture. The fixtures Makefile and scripts/run_e2e.sh drop their icount_spin
    build rule, REQUIRED_ELFS entry, and stale demo reference so the fixture
    build and the bulk runner stay consistent after the cut.

